msgid "Destination path behavior:"
msgstr ""

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/versioned_docs/version-0.12.0/lua-api/ssh.md:482
msgid ""
"When `local_path` is a file and `remote_path` is a file path, the file is "
"uploaded to that exact path."
msgstr ""

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/versioned_docs/version-0.12.0/lua-api/ssh.md:484
msgid ""
"When `local_path` is a file and `remote_path` already exists as a directory, "
"the file is uploaded under that directory using the local file basename."
msgstr ""

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/versioned_docs/version-0.12.0/lua-api/ssh.md:486
msgid ""
"When `local_path` is a file and `remote_path` ends with `/`, `remote_path` "
"is treated as a destination directory path and the uploaded file keeps the "
"local file basename. If that directory does not exist yet, `parents = true` "
"can create it."
msgstr ""

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/versioned_docs/version-0.12.0/lua-api/ssh.md:490
msgid ""
"When `local_path` is a directory and `remote_path` does not exist, "
"`remote_path` becomes the destination directory root."
msgstr ""

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/versioned_docs/version-0.12.0/lua-api/ssh.md:492
msgid ""
"When `local_path` is a directory and `remote_path` already exists as a "
"directory, the source directory is created under it using the source "
"directory basename."
msgstr ""

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/versioned_docs/version-0.12.0/lua-api/ssh.md:495
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/versioned_docs/version-0.12.0/lua-api/ssh.md:495"
msgid ""
"`overwrite = false` rejects an already-existing destination directory for "
"the final directory root."
msgstr ""

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/versioned_docs/version-0.12.0/lua-api/ssh.md:497
